{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f CarCam - Childhood Chaos on Four Tiny Wheels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when the living room was your racetrack, the sofa your mountain, and your RC car your best friend? CarCam brings that magic back, throwing you into a larger-than-life world, seen through the tiny lens of a remote-controlled car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf9 Step into a toy-sized universe where everything is oversized and full of opportunity.<br>From wild races to chaotic minigames, every corner of the room hides a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude97 Pick your mode. Own the floor.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race - Drift around table legs and launch off cushions in high-speed challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domination - Steal LEGO bricks, hold control zones, and outsmart rival teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billiard - Smash into balls (and each other!) in this bonkers, car-fueled twist on the pool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Roam - No rules, no rush. Just explore, drift, and vibe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play solo, local, or online \u2013 but watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grumpy house owner doesn\u2019t like surprises\u2026 especially four-wheeled ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 CarCam isn\u2019t just a game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the thrill of childhood rediscovered.<br>The joy of turning a simple room into your personal playground.<br>And the freedom to race like nobody\u2019s watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and bring the chaos home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760600?t=1767704471","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760600/a06